 "posts": [
  "POWER ADVISORY: CANCELLATION OF SCHEDULED POWER INTERRUPTION ON SEPTEMBER 29, 2026\nTo our valued consumers,\nPlease be informed that the scheduled power interruption affecting a Portion of RF1 - Prk. Boulevard, Brgy. 16, Bacolod City, on September 29, 2026 (Tuesday) has been Cancelled due to necessary adjustments in the scheduled date. This decision was made to accommodate operational requirements and ensure a more efficient execution of maintenance activities.\nThank you for your kind understanding and continued cooperation as we work to serve you better.",
  "SCHEDULED POWER INTERRUPTION: SEPTEMBER 29, 2026\nGinapahibalo sang Negros Power ang mga konsumidores nga may ara sang natalana nga power interruption sa September 29, 2026 (Tuesday).\nIni kabahin sang 5-year rehabilitation kag modernization plan sang Negros Power agud malikawan ang mga wala ginalauman kag mas lapnagon nga power interruptions kag mangin reliable ang distribution system sang aton elektrisidad.\nYari ang mga detalye sang scheduled power interruption:\nDate: September 29, 2026 (Tuesday)\nReason: Installation of check meters.\nTime & Affected Areas:\n7:00AM to 11:00AM\nPortion of RF1 - Prk. Boulevard, Brgy. 16, Bacolod City.\nMadamo gid nga salamat sa inyo nga pag hangop.\n#NegrosPowerRehab\n#PadayonAngRehabilitasyon\n#ForBetterElectricService"
 ],
